# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Render intermediates.
#
# `render/` is ~420MB of 2k PNGs, job JSON and error logs — the OUTPUT of the
# image and video pipeline. The PROMPTS beside them are the reproducible source
# and are tracked: .txt, .pair, .refs and .frames total about 560KB, and with
# scripts/ they are what actually regenerates the film. The frames that ship are
# the packed webp and mp4 under public/lp/, which are tracked.
#
# Ignoring by extension rather than by path so a new beat's prompts are tracked
# automatically and its renders are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/render/**/*.png
/render/**/*.jpg
/render/**/*.jpeg
/render/**/*.webp
/render/**/*.mp4
/render/**/*.json
/render/**/*.err

# Review contact sheets are generated from public/lp — the notes beside them
# are not, so those stay.
/review/**/*.png
/review/**/*.jpg
/review/**/*.jpeg
/lp4-hero.png

# lp-concepts §1.2: "The one asset in brand-assets/amin/ that reproduces his
# race number and bolt outright is quarantined and passed to no generator."
# Quarantined means quarantined — it is not committed either.
/brand-assets/amin/reject-mcqueen-95-lightning.jpeg
